(256,'Triumph Tiger 900 — 2024 generation T-Plane engine improvement','https://www.triumphmotorcycles.co.uk/for-the-ride/news/motorcycles/tiger-900-q-and-a-2024-05-28','manufacturer_primary_source_exact_model_checked_2026_11_12','Triumph 2024 family range, weight is lowest family bike, NOT assigned to every GT/Rally model or older 900.','Triumph Motorcycles — Tiger 900 Your Questions Our Answers, 25 April 2024'),
(257,'Triumph Tiger 900 GT Pro — 2024-on manufacturer engine specification','https://www.triumphmotorcycles.co.uk/motorcycles/adventure/tiger-900/specification','manufacturer_primary_source_exact_model_checked_2026_11_12','Triumph published GT Pro spec for 2024-generation range; dynamic page may later change; record scoped to current documented generation, not claimed for 2020-era GT Pro.','Triumph Motorcycles — Tiger 900 GT Pro factory specification'),
(258,'Triumph Tiger 900 Rally Pro — 2024 adventure chassis distinction','https://www.triumphmotorcycles.co.uk/motorcycles/adventure/tiger-900/tiger-900-rally-pro-2024','manufacturer_primary_source_exact_model_checked_2026_11_12','Specifically 2024 Rally Pro, not the cast-wheel road-oriented GT Pro.','Triumph Motorcycles — Tiger 900 Rally Pro 2024 factory specification'),
(102,'Ducati Monster 937 — 2020 announcement and April 2021 dealer launch','https://mediahouse.ducati.com/light-compact-accessible-and-fun-ducati-presents-new-monster/?lang=eng','manufacturer_primary_source_exact_model_checked_2026_11_12','2020 announcement, 2021 release; exact 937cc generation not older Monster 821/1200 or 2026 replacement.','Ducati Media House — Light, compact, accessible and fun, 2 Dec 2020'),
(102,'Ducati Monster 937 — 2021 Testastretta 11-degree generation','https://www.ducati.com/gb/en/news/production-of-the-new-monster-begins','manufacturer_primary_source_exact_model_checked_2026_11_12','Source specifies 937 Monster introduced 2021, not timeless Monster family. Torque preserved in original manufacturer unit rather than website typo.','Ducati — Production of the new Monster begins, 2021'),
(104,'Ducati Multistrada V4 — original 2020 V4 Granturismo powertrain introduction','https://www.ducati.com/ww/en/news/v4-granturismo-the-engine-for-the-nextgeneration-of-ducati-multistrada','manufacturer_primary_source_exact_model_checked_2026_11_12','Original 2020 engine announcement. Current model-page specs (170hp at 10750, 124Nm at 9000) differ; avoid mixing versions; do not describe as the current 2026 specification.','Ducati — V4 Granturismo: engine for the next generation of Multistrada')
